# Who must approve changes. Enforced when branch protection has
# "Require review from Code Owners" (see docs/branch-protection.md).
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching pattern, so keep the catch-all first and give every line the
# same owner; tests/test_codeowners.py fails if that stops being true.
#
# Why these paths: a merged change to any of them can switch off or forge the scan
# (threat T-D12, rule SCANNER-TAMPER), or changes code that runs with a write token.

*                       @sinan-can-demir
/.github/               @sinan-can-demir
/.pr-scanner.yml        @sinan-can-demir
/.pr-scanner.yaml       @sinan-can-demir
/src/pr_scanner/        @sinan-can-demir
/docs/adr/              @sinan-can-demir
